---
description: How to use the Wavelength MCP tools for diagrams
alwaysApply: false
---

- When the user asks for a flowchart or process diagram of code, use the Wavelength tools instead of writing a diagram by hand.
- Prefer create_flow_from_graph and update_graph for code. They save the exact graph that you build.
- Use create_flow_from_text for notes, transcripts, and plain-language descriptions.
- Export with export_flow (mermaid, svg, drawio, or json) when the user wants a file.
